### Test invalid market data
POST http://localhost:4000/api/markets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "Fintech",
  "region": "East Africa",
  "growthRate": "invalid",
  "description": "Test market",
  "marketSize": "KSh 10 billion",
  "riskLevel": "EXTREME"
}


### UPDATE ENDPOINTS


### Update existing market
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/markets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Health Insurance",
    "category":"Healtchcare",
    "region":"East Africa",
    "growthRate":9.1,
    "description":"A growing healthcare insurance market with increasing demand for private medical cover.",
    "marketSize":"Ksh 12 billion",
    "riskLevel":"MEDIUM"
}

### Test update validation - invalid data
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/markets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "Fintech",
  "region": "East Africa",
  "growthRate": "invalid",
  "description": "Updated test market",
  "marketSize": "KSh 10 billion",
  "riskLevel": "EXTREME"
}



### DELETE ENDPOINTS


### DELETE existing market
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/markets/2
Content-Type: application/json

### Test invalid ID
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/markets/abc

### Test non-existent market
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/markets/999999

